title: Fortios: HA statistics
agents: special
catalog: network/fortigate
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check shows general statistics for each member of a Fortigate HA
 cluster individually, complementing the per-node CPU, memory and
 session checks.
 It receives the data from the "monitor/system/ha-statistics" API
 endpoint, which reports statistics per cluster node.
 One service per cluster node is created, named after the hostname
 of the respective node (e.g. "HA statistics cust-fwl-001.domain.local").

 The service reports the node's serial number, uptime, total
 throughput and packet count, as well as network, virus scan and
 interrupt usage. Per-VDOM CPU, memory and session figures are shown
 in the service details.


 The special agent is required for this check,
 which can be configured via “FortiOS”.

item:
 The hostname of the cluster node as reported by the firewall.

discovery:
 One service per cluster node is created.
